  "content_type": "paragraph",
  "content_text": "咩唔係咁掂：\n[What did not go so well:]\n我老實講，我已經養成咗通宵埋頭做嘢，仲將提交都推到半夜之後嘅習慣。\n[I will be honest, I fell into a pattern of burning the midnight oil and pushing commits past midnight.]\n雖然成個效果喺紙上睇落幾正，但我喺星期四嘅公關稿入面捉到兩個粗心大意嘅錯，其實我應該即刻就發現嘅。\n[While the output looked great on paper, I caught two sloppy mistakes in Thursday PR that I should have caught immediately.]\n深夜嘅我唔係我最叻嘅評論人。\n[Late-night me is not my best reviewer.]\n有一樣要改善：\n[One thing to improve:]\n下星期開始，我會將代碼審查嘅截止時間定喺晚上十一點。\n[Starting next week, I am setting a hard stop at 11 PM for code reviews.]\n之後嘅嘢都會存做草稿，留到隔朝早先睇。\n[Anything after that gets saved as a draft for the next morning.]\n星期一開會時歡迎大家討論。祝好，Leone。\n[Happy to discuss in Monday standup. Best, Leone.]",
